"6325","[AI-translation] Anayefunga Ramadhani kwa Imani na kutarajia malipo, ataghufiriwa dhambi zake zilizotangulia na zilizobaki."
"6326","[AI-translation] Anayefunga Ramadhani kwa Imani na kutarajia malipo, ataghufiriwa dhambi zake zilizotangulia."
