"6343","[AI-translation] Anayeswali Alfajiri yuko katika ulinzi wa Mwenyezi Mungu hadi jioni."
"6344","[AI-translation] Anayeswali Alfajiri yuko katika ulinzi wa Mwenyezi Mungu, basi Mwenyezi Mungu Asiwafuate kwa kitu chochote cha ulinzi Wake."
"6345","[AI-translation] Anayeswali Alfajiri yuko katika ulinzi wa Mwenyezi Mungu na hesabu yake ni kwa Mwenyezi Mungu."
"6346","[AI-translation] Anayeswali Alfajiri kwa jamaa kisha akaketi akimtaja Mwenyezi Mungu hadi jua lichomoze, kisha akaswali rak'aa mbili, atakuwa na ujira kama wa Hija na Umra kamilifu, kamilifu, kamilifu."
"6347","[AI-translation] Anayeswali rak'aa moja ya Alfajiri kisha jua likachomoza, na akamilishe Swala ya Alfajiri."
"6348","[AI-translation] Anayeswali Swala bila kuikamilisha, anaongeewa kutoka kwenye tasbihi zake hadi ikamilike."
"6349","[AI-translation] Anayeswali Swala bila kusoma Fatiha ndani yake, ni yenye upungufu, yenye upungufu, yenye upungufu, haijakamilika."
"6350","[AI-translation] Anayeswali Swala yetu, akielekea qibla yetu, na kula dhabihu yetu, basi huyo ndiye Muislamu ambaye ana ulinzi wa Mwenyezi Mungu na ulinzi wa Mtume Wake; basi msimvunje Mwenyezi Mungu katika ulinzi Wake."
"6351","[AI-translation] Anayeswali Swala yetu na akatoa dhabihu yetu amepata ibada; na anayetoa dhabihu kabla ya Swala hana ibada."
"6352","[AI-translation] Anayeswali maiti ana qirati; na akishuhudia kuzikwa kwake ana qirati mbili, na qirati ni kama Uhud."
