"6358","[AI-translation] Anayeniswalia mara moja, Mwenyezi Mungu Anamsalia kwa hiyo mara kumi."
"6359","[AI-translation] Anayeniswalia mara moja, Mwenyezi Mungu Anamsalia mara kumi, Anamfutia dhambi kumi, na Anamwinua daraja kumi."
"6360","[AI-translation] Anayeswali katika siku na usiku rak'aa kumi na mbili za sunna, Mwenyezi Mungu Atamjengea nyumba Peponi."
