"6377","[AI-translation] Anayebahamisha mali kuitumia na usiku kujishughulisha na ibada, basi aseme: Subhanallahi wa bihamdihi."
"6378","[AI-translation] Anayebana mahali, au kukata njia, au kumwudhi Muumini, hana jihadi."
"6379","[AI-translation] Anayetawafu Nyumba mara saba na akaswali rak'aa mbili, ni kama kumwacha huru mtumwa."
"6380","[AI-translation] Anayetawafu Nyumba hii mzunguko mmoja na akahesabu, ni kama kumwacha huru mtumwa; haweki mguu wala hauondoi mwingine isipokuwa Mwenyezi Mungu Anamfutia dhambi kwa hilo na Anamwandikia wema kwa hilo."
"6381","[AI-translation] Anayetaka shahada kwa ukweli atapewa ijapo haikumpata."
"6382","[AI-translation] Anayetafuta elimu ili ajivunie kwa wanachuoni, au abishane kwayo na wapumbavu, au aelekeze nyuso za watu kwake, basi yuko Motoni."
"6383","[AI-translation] Anayetafuta elimu ili ashindane kwayo na wanachuoni, au abishane kwayo na wapumbavu, au aelekeze nyuso za watu kwake, Mwenyezi Mungu Atamwingiza Motoni."
"6384","[AI-translation] Anayetaka haki yake, na aitafute kwa ustaarabu na kujizuia, apate kikamilifu au asipate."
"6385","[AI-translation] Anayetia dhuluma kiasi cha shibiri ya ardhi atafungiwa kola ya ardhi saba."
"6386","[AI-translation] Anayemchukia Ammar, Mwenyezi Mungu Atamchukia; na anayemwadhi Ammar, Mwenyezi Mungu Atamwadhi."
"6387","[AI-translation] Anayemtembelea mgonjwa au kumtembelea ndugu yake kwa ajili ya Mwenyezi Mungu, ataitwa na mwitaji: Uwe mzima, mwendo wako uwe mwema, na umejitakabialia makaazi Peponi."
"6388","[AI-translation] Anayemtembelea mgonjwa ambaye kifo chake hakijafika kisha akasema mbele yake mara saba: Naomba kwa Mwenyezi Mungu Mtukufu, Mola wa Arshi Tukufu, akuponye — Mwenyezi Mungu Atamponya ugonjwa huo."
"6389","[AI-translation] Anayemtembelea mgonjwa anaendelea kuwa katika bustani ya Pepo hadi arudi."
"6390","[AI-translation] Anayejikinga kwa Mwenyezi Mungu amejikinga kwa kimbilio madhubuti."
"6391","[AI-translation] Anayelea wasichana wawili hadi wakue, mimi na yeye tutaingia Peponi kama hivi — akaonyesha vidole viwili."
"6392","[AI-translation] Anayepewa rehani (manukato) na asikatae; kwani ni nyepesi kubeba na ni nzuri harufu."
"6393","[AI-translation] Anayepewa manukato na asikatae; kwani ni nyepesi kubeba na ni nzuri harufu."
"6394","[AI-translation] Anayefunga hirizi amemshirikisha."
"6395","[AI-translation] Anayejifunza kurusha mishale kisha akaacha hakuwa miongoni mwetu."
"6396","[AI-translation] Anayefundisha elimu ana ujira wa mwenye kuifanyia amali, bila kupunguza ujira wa mfanyaji."
"6397","[AI-translation] Anayefikisha miaka sabini katika umma wangu, Mwenyezi Mungu Amempa udhuru kuhusu umri."
"6398","[AI-translation] Anayefanya amali isiyo na amri yetu basi ni linalokataliwa."
"6399","[AI-translation] Anayekwenda msikitini asubuhi na jioni, Mwenyezi Mungu Atamwandalia makaazi Peponi kila anapokwenda asubuhi na jioni."
"6400","[AI-translation] Anayepanda mti, hakuna mwanadamu wala kiumbe chochote cha Mwenyezi Mungu kilichokula kutoka humo isipokuwa ni sadaka kwake."
"6401","[AI-translation] Anayepigana katika njia ya Mwenyezi Mungu bila nia isipokuwa kamba ya ngamia, basi anapata alichokusudia."
"6402","[AI-translation] Anayemwosha maiti na aoge; na anayembeba na atawadha."
"6403","[AI-translation] Anayemwosha maiti na akamficha, Mwenyezi Mungu Atamficha dhambi zake; na anayemfunga sanda, Mwenyezi Mungu Atamvika sundus."
"6404","[AI-translation] Anayemwosha maiti na aoge."
"6405","[AI-translation] Anayeoga siku ya Ijumaa na akaoga, kisha akaenda mapema na akafika mapema, akatembea wala hakupanda, akasogea karibu na imamu, akasikiliza na akanyamaza, wala hakufanya upuuzi — atakuwa na ujira wa amali ya mwaka kwa kila hatua anayoikanyaga kutoka nyumbani kwake hadi msikitini: ujira wa kufunga kwake na kusimama kwake."
